() Tj T*
(Quiet hours are from 10 PM to 6 AM. Visitors are allowed only in the visitor lounge) Tj T*
(between 4 PM and 7 PM. Students must return to the hostel before 9 PM unless they hold a) Tj T*
(written late permission from the warden.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(LIBRARY TIMINGS AND SERVICES) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The library is located on the ground floor of the Main Block. It is open from 9 AM to 6 PM) Tj T*
(on weekdays and 9 AM to 1 PM on Saturdays. During examinations it stays open until 8 PM.) Tj T*
(Services include book lending, reference reading, digital journals and photocopying.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BORROWING RULES) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Undergraduate students may borrow up to 3 books for 14 days. Postgraduate students may) Tj T*
(borrow up to 5 books for 21 days. A late fine is charged for each overdue day. Lost books) Tj T*
(must be replaced or paid for at the current price.) Tj T*
